Agent Data Studio — MCP server + KPIM analysis process, tools, templates & techniques
for AI Agents to work with Power BI as a data analyst expert.

Process, tools and techniques built by KPIM (kpim.vn); technical lead & development by
Duc Nguyen (Nguyễn Quang Đức, ducnguyen221). Shared free with the community and students.
Licensed under the MIT License. Please keep attribution/credit to Duc Nguyen when reusing
the KPIM process, templates or tooling.
KPIM assets shared for community reference are listed in NOTICE.md. Those assets are owned
by KPIM (kpim.vn); KPIM permits their use and distribution with this repository under the
MIT License below. When reusing them, please credit KPIM (and Duc Nguyen for the code and
process, as above).

